import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 946 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 12 | Eliminating Great-Material-for-Small-Use","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 946 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 12 | Eliminating Great-Material-for-Small-Use","no":946,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 12","Right Person Right Job","Energy Waste","Anti-Waste"],"related":["10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview","23-20% Activation Strategy Plan","910-20% Activation Strategy"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0946_模块5-规则十二-杜绝大材小用.md","filePath":"en/0946_模块5-规则十二-杜绝大材小用.md"}'),o={name:"en/0946_模块5-规则十二-杜绝大材小用.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,h,c){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-946-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-12-eliminating-great-material-for-small-use" tabindex="-1">Entry 946 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 12 | Eliminating Great-Material-for-Small-Use <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-946-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-12-eliminating-great-material-for-small-use" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 946 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 12 | Eliminating Great-Material-for-Small-Use&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 23 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-let-everyone-stand-where-he-should" tabindex="-1">Introduction: let everyone stand where he should <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-let-everyone-stand-where-he-should" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: let everyone stand where he should&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules must not only prevent &quot;the strong bullying the weak,&quot; but also prevent another kind of waste — trapping a great talent in a small post. A genius who could deduce cosmic laws, if pressed by birth, opportunity, or prejudice into menial labor at the Sense-Condensed Realm, is civilization&#39;s greatest energy drain. Rule 12 writes &quot;eliminate great-material-for-small-use&quot; as a Heavenly-Dao duty: the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization has the responsibility to discover every buried material and place it where it can shine; equally, it does not allow small-material-for-great-use either — that would drag the whole engineering down. Symmetric in both directions is true matching people to their posts.</p><p>The six top-level axioms run through it: the collective-ascension axiom requires &quot;eliminate great-material-for-small-use&quot; to release all potential; the republican axiom of Myriad Races ensures the discovery process asks not about birth; the anti-predation axiom negates &quot;geniuses confined by sects/the strong&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom requires post adjustment respect individual will and existing causality; the law-first axiom lets &quot;talent&quot; assessment, &quot;post&quot; matching, and &quot;transfer&quot; procedure be defined first by law.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-iron-laws-of-person-post-matching" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three Iron Laws of Person-Post Matching <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-iron-laws-of-person-post-matching" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three Iron Laws of Person-Post Matching&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Discovery</strong>: the Alaya Network continuously profiles every being&#39;s talent inclination and adaptation to systems, automatically marking &quot;buried high potential&quot;;</li><li><strong>Matching</strong>: the 300 Origin Cultivation Systems (Document 10) give optimal adaptation per individual profile, avoiding energy waste from &quot;wrong-system placement&quot;;</li><li><strong>Mobility</strong>: those mismatched have the right to free, barrier-free post transfer, school transfer, and system switch; the original unit may not obstruct.</li></ol><p>Eliminating great-material-for-small-use does not force geniuses to &quot;be great&quot;: the individual has the right to choose an ordinary, peaceful life; the network only prompts and recommends, not forces.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>20%-activation argument</strong>: the 20% Activation Strategy Plan (Document 23) points out placing the key 20% high-potential nodes correctly produces the largest overall energy jump;</li><li><strong>Self-growth-utility argument</strong>: the Self-Growing Evolution Law points out every being&#39;s talent is the cosmos&#39;s unique evolutionary increment; placing it wrong zeroes the increment;</li><li><strong>Anti-confinement argument</strong>: old-cosmos sects confining geniuses as private property and locking them in small posts is a form of predatory possession; Rule 12 abolishes it at the allocation level.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network &quot;person-post profiling system&quot; continuously generates talent radars for Myriad-Rank individuals, viewable and correctable by the individual anytime;</li><li>High-potential individuals receive &quot;recommended post/system&quot; notices, and may accept, decline, or apply for re-assessment;</li><li>A &quot;great-material-for-small-use appeal channel&quot; is set: individuals believing themselves buried may apply for independent assessment and resource reallocation;</li><li>For posts genuinely small-material-for-great-use endangering engineering, the Anchor Supervisory Committee coordinates smooth post adjustment, not sudden dismissal.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: post long mismatched, profile not updated, network automatically reminds;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: sects/units under the name of &quot;lineage&quot;/&quot;contract&quot; confining geniuses, obstructing mobility, have the relevant unit&#39;s permissions frozen;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: deliberately pressing high-potential geniuses into dead posts, or forcibly pushing incompetents high, causing civilizational-engineering accidents, relevant decision-makers are pursued back to responsibility.</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s person-post profiling system is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee spot-checks &quot;confinement-style employment&quot; as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates mobility-right-infringement cases as the third layer; the individual himself and each clan&#39;s talent committee exercise final appeal over person-post matching as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: this rule is &quot;anti-energy waste&quot; itself, eliminating great-material-for-small-use and small-material-for-great-use from both ends</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: abolishing the old rule of sects confining geniuses as private property; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type geniuses are &quot;seen&quot; via the protagonist&#39;s halo, other geniuses fend for themselves; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s profiling system automatically finds talent, asking not protagonist-or-not</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: human males and females, Youth Supremes, alien beasts, plant spirits, and consciousness-information clans each have a talent radar, no species limit</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated civilizations&#39; high-potential individuals automatically enter the profiling system, with cross-civilization post scheduling</li></ul><p>Eliminating great-material-for-small-use&#39;s most delicate operation is how to judge &quot;truly great material&quot; vs &quot;self-styled great material.&quot; The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization relies neither on self-evaluation nor on a single talent scout, but on Alaya Network&#39;s long profiling plus multi-source feedback. If a Youth Supreme repeatedly hits walls in the deduction system yet is in his element in the life-cycle system, the network will actively suggest switching; if a self-important striver&#39;s data shows his talent is mediocre, the network also gently hints &quot;ordinary and peaceful is also a legal choice.&quot; Judgment rests in no one&#39;s hands, but at the confluence of Myriad-Rank feedback and causal records. This both prevents great-material-for-small-use and small-material-for-great-use, and further prevents &quot;overestimated geniuses&quot; from wrongly occupying engineering critical points.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Eliminating great-material-for-small-use turns &quot;Myriad Ranks 99% potential&quot; from a slogan into a post table. Civilizational finalization&#39;s efficiency depends on whether every material stands where it should.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/23-20％激活战略规划.html">Entry 23 · 20% Activation Strategy Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/910_模块5-第九条-20％激活战略.html">Entry 910 · Article 9 20% Activation Strategy</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/943_模块5-规则九-抬着万族一起进化.html">Entry 943 · Rule 9 Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
